+**GTA RP (Portuguese roleplay streams).** Other players talk over voice chat: in RP their lines are part
+of the scene, so keep them when the streamer reacts or the exchange is funny by itself. Best RP moments:
+chases that end in a crash or arrest, robberies that go wrong, absurd courtroom / police dialogue, the
+streamer breaking character laughing, a betrayal. Drop long in-character planning, menu / inventory time,
+and anything that needs knowing the server's story. Use the character name in `why` only if the clip says it.
